  "triples": [
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Mitya",
      "quote": "He told them how he had leapt over the fence into his father’s garden",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Smerdyakov",
      "quote": "Besides, what motive had he for murdering the old man? Why, he’s very likely his son, you know—his natural son. Do you know that?",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "SERVANT_OF",
      "object": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "quote": "So no one knew of the signals but your dead father, you, and the valet Smerdyakov? And no one else?",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "POSSESSES",
      "object": "pestle",
      "quote": "seeing his father peering out of the window, his hatred flared up and he pulled the pestle out of his pocket",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Grigory",
      "quote": "sitting on the wall, he had struck Grigory on the head with the pestle, while the old man had hold of his left leg",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "quote": "after dramatically describing how I wanted to kill him, and how I snatched up the pestle—I suddenly run away from the window.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Grigory",
      "quote": "Scarcely had Mitya described how, sitting on the wall, he had struck Grigory on the head with the pestle, while the old man had hold of his left leg",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "POSSESSES",
      "object": "pestle",
      "quote": "“And the pestle?” “The pestle was in my hand.”",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "POSSESSES",
      "object": "pistols",
      "quote": "So I went to redeem the pistols I had pledged, to load them and put a bullet in my brain to-morrow.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Mitya",
      "relation": "ACCUSED_OF",
      "object": "murder and robbing of Mitya's father",
      "quote": "The answer to the question where I got the money would expose me to far greater disgrace than the murder and robbing of my father, if I had murdered and robbed him.",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 58,
      "doc_id": "ch058",
      "label_ko": "9편 5장"
    },
